(1306903, 166774, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot with a lot of color, detail and sharpness.  I like it a lot.  However as there is a horizontal waterline I would have straightened this along that line just below the base of the mountains.  First glance the picture seems to be tilted to the right.  Technically sound shot otherwise.  Good job.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot with a lot of color, detail and sharpness.  I like it a lot.  However as there is a horizontal waterline I would have straightened this along that line just below the base of the mountains.  First glance the picture seems to be tilted to the right.  Technically sound shot otherwise.  Good job.', '2005-04-20 02:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306915, 168589, 21367, '<td valign="top">Technically sound, creative and well executed shot.  One of my picks thus far.  Don''t tak this the wrong way (it''s that attention to detail thing I have going) but clean up cuticals on the hand and you got yourself a wicked stock photo or poster.  The whites around the finger nails just seem to jump out at me.</td>', 'Technically sound, creative and well executed shot.  One of my picks thus far.  Don''t tak this the wrong way (it''s that attention to detail thing I have going) but clean up cuticals on the hand and you got yourself a wicked stock photo or poster.  The whites around the finger nails just seem to jump out at me.', '2005-04-20 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306920, 167245, 30857, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition, too bad the shadow on the right side of the picture, it is very distracting</td>', 'Good idea and composition, too bad the shadow on the right side of the picture, it is very distracting', '2005-04-20 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306927, 168375, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of "The Rock", I haven''t seen that place in years.  Anyways, great composition, excellent clarity (looks like you got some L glass there).  I like the lighting of the foreground and Island, I would like to see a little more color in the sky but I know how tough it is to pull this shot off.  Excellent Job.  One of my picks.</td>', 'Excellent shot of "The Rock", I haven''t seen that place in years.  Anyways, great composition, excellent clarity (looks like you got some L glass there).  I like the lighting of the foreground and Island, I would like to see a little more color in the sky but I know how tough it is to pull this shot off.  Excellent Job.  One of my picks.', '2005-04-20 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306930, 166682, 30857, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but the main focus of it is not the rock but the tiger ...</td>', 'Very nice picture, but the main focus of it is not the rock but the tiger ...', '2005-04-20 02:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306931, 168635, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellet Tones, Clarity and detail.  One of my picks.  You took a mundane challange topic and made it visually pleasing.  The close in tight crop works well here.  good luck.</td>', 'Excellet Tones, Clarity and detail.  One of my picks.  You took a mundane challange topic and made it visually pleasing.  The close in tight crop works well here.  good luck.', '2005-04-20 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306938, 168414, 30857, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but stone is not the main focus of it ... just a background</td>', 'Great picture, but stone is not the main focus of it ... just a background', '2005-04-20 02:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
