(1306966, 168624, 36604, '<td valign="top">Okay, the paper boat sailing in a sea of rocks is cute, but the presence of the scissors seems forced, and the shot is blurry.  I would have suggested perhaps painting a flag with the symbol of a scissors instead, and then going for a better focused shot, perhaps at a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Okay, the paper boat sailing in a sea of rocks is cute, but the presence of the scissors seems forced, and the shot is blurry.  I would have suggested perhaps painting a flag with the symbol of a scissors instead, and then going for a better focused shot, perhaps at a smaller aperture.', '2005-04-20 02:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306972, 166915, 36604, '<td valign="top">The glare on the scissors is a bit harsh.</td>', 'The glare on the scissors is a bit harsh.', '2005-04-20 02:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
