(1307774, 168518, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very humouristic approach of the challenge, and very well executed too. You''ve managed to include all three items, without making the picture boring and in a very original way. Congratulations. 9</td>', 'Very humouristic approach of the challenge, and very well executed too. You''ve managed to include all three items, without making the picture boring and in a very original way. Congratulations. 9', '2005-04-20 12:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307777, 168579, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Simple, yet appearing to be very well executed. I just wish it were a little brighter, though you''ve managed to create good light/shadow effects.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Simple, yet appearing to be very well executed. I just wish it were a little brighter, though you''ve managed to create good light/shadow effects.Congratulations.', '2005-04-20 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307782, 168281, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very good image, although a little complex. Neverthless, you''ve managed to create a good composition from an original and different idea.</td>', 'Very good image, although a little complex. Neverthless, you''ve managed to create a good composition from an original and different idea.', '2005-04-20 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307785, 168297, 2563, '<td valign="top">extremely original. I don''t really like the cloth in the mirror (even if I understands its purpose)  but the idea is great and I like the colors. 9</td>', 'extremely original. I don''t really like the cloth in the mirror (even if I understands its purpose)  but the idea is great and I like the colors. 9', '2005-04-20 12:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307786, 168629, 31211, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Just love this "bathroom" and its beautifual view.  Good choice of b&amp;w, though I feel the sinks should be a little more sharper. Anyway, good composition, great quality and I hope you do well on this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot. Just love this "bathroom" and its beautifual view.  Good choice of b&w, though I feel the sinks should be a little more sharper. Anyway, good composition, great quality and I hope you do well on this challenge.', '2005-04-20 12:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307789, 168635, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice effects and warm colors. Not the most original concept, but very well executed. The final result is very good. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice effects and warm colors. Not the most original concept, but very well executed. The final result is very good. Nice job.', '2005-04-20 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307796, 168451, 31211, '<td valign="top">While I feel you image lacks the wow factor, it sure has great quality and definition. I''m not thrilled by your subject, but I have to say you''ve managed to capture it in a most professional way, which makes it stand out.Nice job.</td>', 'While I feel you image lacks the wow factor, it sure has great quality and definition. I''m not thrilled by your subject, but I have to say you''ve managed to capture it in a most professional way, which makes it stand out.Nice job.', '2005-04-20 12:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307799, 166774, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very good one. No flaws to point out... except, I have this problem with the road not being completely horizontal. Anyway, great, great picture, which I hope does welll on this challenge.</td>', 'Very good one. No flaws to point out... except, I have this problem with the road not being completely horizontal. Anyway, great, great picture, which I hope does welll on this challenge.', '2005-04-20 12:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
