(1309508, 167884, 31889, '<td valign="top">Can I suggest that with your next entry you try a larger picture.</td>', 'Can I suggest that with your next entry you try a larger picture.', '2005-04-20 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309529, 168674, 18799, '<td valign="top">The white flowers are pretty much blown out due to the time of day the shot was taken.  I bet if you took it in early morning or in the evening sunlight it would be much better.   5</td>', 'The white flowers are pretty much blown out due to the time of day the shot was taken.  I bet if you took it in early morning or in the evening sunlight it would be much better.   5', '2005-04-20 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309531, 166905, 35366, '<td valign="top">good one the best i''ve seen</td>', 'good one the best i''ve seen', '2005-04-20 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309539, 166915, 35366, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2005-04-20 22:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309552, 166555, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think you cropped the Buddas too close to the edges, I want to see the whole thing here.</td>', 'I think you cropped the Buddas too close to the edges, I want to see the whole thing here.', '2005-04-20 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309559, 167207, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very strange... extra points!</td>', 'Very strange... extra points!', '2005-04-20 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309568, 168423, 18799, '<td valign="top">No offense, but this composition isn''t very compelling.  I think the winner of a challenge like this will be one who can show the objects in an interesting and unusual way.  I think with a little more thought you could have come up with a way to photograph these objects more dynamically.   5 for being on topic, well exposed and in focus.</td>', 'No offense, but this composition isn''t very compelling.  I think the winner of a challenge like this will be one who can show the objects in an interesting and unusual way.  I think with a little more thought you could have come up with a way to photograph these objects more dynamically.   5 for being on topic, well exposed and in focus.', '2005-04-20 22:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309570, 168073, 18870, '<td valign="top">looks like another dirty old man shot without model consent.</td>', 'looks like another dirty old man shot without model consent.', '2005-04-20 22:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309581, 168231, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good for you for going out on a limb with this unusual angle.  The only problem I have is that the rock seems to be a minor part of the composition.  6</td>', 'Good for you for going out on a limb with this unusual angle.  The only problem I have is that the rock seems to be a minor part of the composition.  6', '2005-04-20 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309586, 167970, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little busy.  There are a lot of elements that (IMO) really don''t flow well.  I find myself randomly going from one subgroup to another without any particular reason. 5</td>', 'I think this is a little busy.  There are a lot of elements that (IMO) really don''t flow well.  I find myself randomly going from one subgroup to another without any particular reason. 5', '2005-04-20 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309589, 167880, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the relevance to the challenge, I see wood, steel and trees.  Is the pointed element called a sissors?   Sorry, it''s lost on me.</td>', 'I don''t see the relevance to the challenge, I see wood, steel and trees.  Is the pointed element called a sissors?   Sorry, it''s lost on me.', '2005-04-20 23:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309593, 168684, 18799, '<td valign="top">Ouch, that was painful (the pun)</td>', 'Ouch, that was painful (the pun)', '2005-04-20 23:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309594, 168231, 31211, '<td valign="top">Well, the picture has a nice sky perspective and the girl''s eyes draw you to the stone. But I find  the stone to be too small and her lower area too much "in the face", which is a turn off. Othewise, its an ok, average shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Well, the picture has a nice sky perspective and the girl''s eyes draw you to the stone. But I find  the stone to be too small and her lower area too much "in the face", which is a turn off. Othewise, its an ok, average shot. Good luck.', '2005-04-20 23:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309596, 167091, 19978, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, what appeal from a simple shot of a scissors. It is this kind of photographic vision that keeps me coming back to this site. Your shot makes it worth it to click through dozens of OK photographs just to wait for that moment of brilliance.  About the shot, such excellent visual appeal, such sharp lines and contrasting colors. The bottom part of the orange seems a bit off in color, but that might just be the texture of the plastic itself. This image is my first (and maybe only) 10 of the challenge. Hats off to you.</td>', 'Fantastic, what appeal from a simple shot of a scissors. It is this kind of photographic vision that keeps me coming back to this site. Your shot makes it worth it to click through dozens of OK photographs just to wait for that moment of brilliance.  About the shot, such excellent visual appeal, such sharp lines and contrasting colors. The bottom part of the orange seems a bit off in color, but that might just be the texture of the plastic itself. This image is my first (and maybe only) 10 of the challenge. Hats off to you.', '2005-04-20 23:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309601, 168227, 19978, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and contrast. A very visually appealing shot. More light on the scissors to make the blue color there pop too, would be my only idea for improvement. Very well done!</td>', 'Gorgeous color and contrast. A very visually appealing shot. More light on the scissors to make the blue color there pop too, would be my only idea for improvement. Very well done!', '2005-04-20 23:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309604, 168712, 18799, '<td valign="top">Funny!  I find the fabric color very complimentary, but the texture distracting.  I think a different crop, maybe tighter, would have been more effective.   For humor, 6</td>', 'Funny!  I find the fabric color very complimentary, but the texture distracting.  I think a different crop, maybe tighter, would have been more effective.   For humor, 6', '2005-04-20 23:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309605, 168423, 31211, '<td valign="top">Though you''ve included all three items in your shot, your composition lacks creativity and impact. The picture looks too soft and I find it to be too small, when you have the option to submit 640x640px sized pictures.<br/>Maybe by adding contrast and sharpenning the image, it''ll look better.</td>', 'Though you''ve included all three items in your shot, your composition lacks creativity and impact. The picture looks too soft and I find it to be too small, when you have the option to submit 640x640px sized pictures.Maybe by adding contrast and sharpenning the image, it''ll look better.', '2005-04-20 23:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309606, 167569, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love the blur, love the color, love the simplicity. Beautifully done image. Great imagination, great composition, crop, etc. Given the absolute simplicity of the idea, I would have cleaned and polished the scissor blade and reshot. That''s the only (minor) complaint. Good entry!</td>', 'Love the blur, love the color, love the simplicity. Beautifully done image. Great imagination, great composition, crop, etc. Given the absolute simplicity of the idea, I would have cleaned and polished the scissor blade and reshot. That''s the only (minor) complaint. Good entry!', '2005-04-20 23:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309607, 167302, 18799, '<td valign="top">I find the tapestry background very distracting in this image</td>', 'I find the tapestry background very distracting in this image', '2005-04-20 23:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309612, 166591, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, and while I love your "paper" idea, I bet you''re getting hammered in the voting because "no rocks or scissors," right. Too bad. This is a wonderful shot. Save this idea for a winter seasonal challenge sometime, and in the meantime, know that somebody in THIS challenge appreciates your vision. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful image, and while I love your "paper" idea, I bet you''re getting hammered in the voting because "no rocks or scissors," right. Too bad. This is a wonderful shot. Save this idea for a winter seasonal challenge sometime, and in the meantime, know that somebody in THIS challenge appreciates your vision. 8.', '2005-04-20 23:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309619, 168578, 31211, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original set up. However, I feel you could have arranged a better composition and a better background. Its an average image, which i feel lacks impact and vibrant colors, in order to make it appealing. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting and original set up. However, I feel you could have arranged a better composition and a better background. Its an average image, which i feel lacks impact and vibrant colors, in order to make it appealing. Good luck.', '2005-04-20 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309624, 167010, 18799, '<td valign="top">That''s a stretch</td>', 'That''s a stretch', '2005-04-20 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309625, 168297, 19978, '<td valign="top">Quite a serious job composing and setting this one up. Great concept. The execution seems to be lacking in punch somehow though. Maybe a closer crop, ignoring the points of the blades and the negative space at the top? I''m not sure. Maybe find a way to avoid the awkward wall-mirror-drape complication in the back?? Great concept but probably could have used some tweaking. Are you getting hammered because of no rocks or paper? Thought so.</td>', 'Quite a serious job composing and setting this one up. Great concept. The execution seems to be lacking in punch somehow though. Maybe a closer crop, ignoring the points of the blades and the negative space at the top? I''m not sure. Maybe find a way to avoid the awkward wall-mirror-drape complication in the back?? Great concept but probably could have used some tweaking. Are you getting hammered because of no rocks or paper? Thought so.', '2005-04-20 23:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309627, 167880, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''m seeing a connection to the challenge, but a nice image anyway.</td>', 'I''m not sure I''m seeing a connection to the challenge, but a nice image anyway.', '2005-04-20 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309628, 168087, 24991, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty noisy....  Nice composition though.</td>', 'This shot is pretty noisy....  Nice composition though.', '2005-04-20 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309632, 166931, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the color treatment, and the sharpness.  I find the border, however, to be very distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition, the color treatment, and the sharpness.  I find the border, however, to be very distracting.', '2005-04-20 23:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1309633, 167371, 19978, '<td valign="top">Awesome! What the devil?? I have no idea where you found this, but keep photographing it, the geologist in me (amateur) is fascinated!</td>', 'Awesome! What the devil?? I have no idea where you found this, but keep photographing it, the geologist in me (amateur) is fascinated!', '2005-04-20 23:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
