(1310028, 168670, 36547, '<td valign="top">I would have loved it without the white paper base - I think the rock alone would have met the challenge qualification</td>', 'I would have loved it without the white paper base - I think the rock alone would have met the challenge qualification', '2005-04-21 01:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310033, 167586, 21367, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... the colors seem to make this a busy shot, almost like it is over saturated.  Using a faster shutter speed or negative (-) exposure comp might have calmed this down enough to save the hot highlights on the leaves in the upper right, the entire shot would have been darker but it is easier to bring the levels up in an editing program than darken areas with no detail.  As it is I might have desaturated it a bit or brought the green channel down a little to give it a more natural feel and give a little pop to the darker areas.</td>', 'Interesting shot... the colors seem to make this a busy shot, almost like it is over saturated.  Using a faster shutter speed or negative (-) exposure comp might have calmed this down enough to save the hot highlights on the leaves in the upper right, the entire shot would have been darker but it is easier to bring the levels up in an editing program than darken areas with no detail.  As it is I might have desaturated it a bit or brought the green channel down a little to give it a more natural feel and give a little pop to the darker areas.', '2005-04-21 01:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310036, 167349, 21367, '<td valign="top">Kudos for a technically sound shot.  Dof and lighting are very good and the crop fits the composition well.</td>', 'Kudos for a technically sound shot.  Dof and lighting are very good and the crop fits the composition well.', '2005-04-21 01:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310047, 167105, 21367, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity behind this one.  Cool composition.  Personally the only  that I would like to see different would be the lighting on the hot edge of the scissors, beyond that great shot.  The crop bodes well here.</td>', 'I like the creativity behind this one.  Cool composition.  Personally the only  that I would like to see different would be the lighting on the hot edge of the scissors, beyond that great shot.  The crop bodes well here.', '2005-04-21 02:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310051, 168451, 21367, '<td valign="top">Technically sound shot.  Lighting and Clarity are excellent.</td>', 'Technically sound shot.  Lighting and Clarity are excellent.', '2005-04-21 02:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310054, 167970, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I don''t know that duo tone was the best way to present this as the hands and triangle in the the upper left really stand out.  I like how you have made all elements of the challenge hidden but stand out equally as much.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I don''t know that duo tone was the best way to present this as the hands and triangle in the the upper left really stand out.  I like how you have made all elements of the challenge hidden but stand out equally as much.  Good job.', '2005-04-21 02:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1310356, 166358, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and will come close to winning this challenge. Some will find the exaggerated saturation and what appears to be huge amounts of NI overpowering, but to be honest I quite like the effect. My main qualm with this image is that it''s a little hard to consider what appears to be an island with trees growing on it to be a rock.</td>', 'This is beautiful and will come close to winning this challenge. Some will find the exaggerated saturation and what appears to be huge amounts of NI overpowering, but to be honest I quite like the effect. My main qualm with this image is that it''s a little hard to consider what appears to be an island with trees growing on it to be a rock.', '2005-04-21 04:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
