(1311237, 167200, 36324, '<td valign="top">Lower vote for focus.</td>', 'Lower vote for focus.', '2005-04-21 15:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311238, 168153, 36324, '<td valign="top">Color Color Color. Very nice</td>', 'Color Color Color. Very nice', '2005-04-21 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311240, 168173, 36324, '<td valign="top">Great application of a difficult subject. Pretty.</td>', 'Great application of a difficult subject. Pretty.', '2005-04-21 15:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311242, 167140, 33249, '<td valign="top">aahhh... the old see through desktop. one of the best i''ve seen</td>', 'aahhh... the old see through desktop. one of the best i''ve seen', '2005-04-21 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311246, 167335, 10261, '<td valign="top">How does he pull the trigger?<br/> <br/>The idea is amusing, but the odd lighting with the multi-angle shadows and the low contrast makes the image seem a bit unpolished.</td>', 'How does he pull the trigger? The idea is amusing, but the odd lighting with the multi-angle shadows and the low contrast makes the image seem a bit unpolished.', '2005-04-21 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311251, 166423, 10261, '<td valign="top">The image seems rather cluttered. A shallower DOF may have helped you to reduce the clutter and emphasize the subject.</td>', 'The image seems rather cluttered. A shallower DOF may have helped you to reduce the clutter and emphasize the subject.', '2005-04-21 16:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311253, 167458, 10261, '<td valign="top">The hot spots detract from the image.</td>', 'The hot spots detract from the image.', '2005-04-21 16:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311257, 168674, 10261, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting detracts from what might have otherwise been a nice shot. Coming back to this place on an overcast day would have yielded much better results.</td>', 'The harsh lighting detracts from what might have otherwise been a nice shot. Coming back to this place on an overcast day would have yielded much better results.', '2005-04-21 16:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311259, 168396, 10261, '<td valign="top">I find the shadow from the top blade of the scissors distracting. A slightly deeper DOF would have allowed you to keep the bottom handle and fingers in focus.</td>', 'I find the shadow from the top blade of the scissors distracting. A slightly deeper DOF would have allowed you to keep the bottom handle and fingers in focus.', '2005-04-21 16:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311264, 168576, 29348, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!9</td>', 'Nice shot!9', '2005-04-21 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311267, 168154, 10261, '<td valign="top">A shallower DOF may have helped you to reduce the clutter and emphasize the subject. Both the title and the cryptic subject suggest that there''s some deeper meaning here, but I can''t figure out what it is.</td>', 'A shallower DOF may have helped you to reduce the clutter and emphasize the subject. Both the title and the cryptic subject suggest that there''s some deeper meaning here, but I can''t figure out what it is.', '2005-04-21 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311270, 168394, 32767, '<td valign="top">Cool concept but a little muddy.</td>', 'Cool concept but a little muddy.', '2005-04-21 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311272, 168140, 10261, '<td valign="top">The shadow covering the face of the white knight works against you here. I think I would have preferred to see more regal looking scissors embedded in the stone, and shooting from a lower angle might offer a more interesting perspective.</td>', 'The shadow covering the face of the white knight works against you here. I think I would have preferred to see more regal looking scissors embedded in the stone, and shooting from a lower angle might offer a more interesting perspective.', '2005-04-21 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311274, 166429, 10261, '<td valign="top">Like many of the images in this challenge, this was shot under rather harsh, directional light.</td>', 'Like many of the images in this challenge, this was shot under rather harsh, directional light.', '2005-04-21 16:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311276, 167349, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is very, very similar to mine but much better. Well done.<br/> <br/>Via Con Dios!</td>', 'This is very, very similar to mine but much better. Well done. Via Con Dios!', '2005-04-21 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311277, 168589, 29348, '<td valign="top">Amazing pic. I want to try this myself!  10.</td>', 'Amazing pic. I want to try this myself!  10.', '2005-04-21 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311278, 167369, 10261, '<td valign="top">The dog gives the image a sense of proportion, but I feel that it detracts from the presentation overall.</td>', 'The dog gives the image a sense of proportion, but I feel that it detracts from the presentation overall.', '2005-04-21 16:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311283, 168400, 29348, '<td valign="top">If you made this image a little darker I would give it a nine.</td>', 'If you made this image a little darker I would give it a nine.', '2005-04-21 16:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311287, 167349, 29348, '<td valign="top">How did you do that?!</td>', 'How did you do that?!', '2005-04-21 16:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311290, 168703, 10261, '<td valign="top">Are Canadian pennies no longer made of copper? I think that the contrasting color of the two metals would have made this a more interesting shot. Good DOF</td>', 'Are Canadian pennies no longer made of copper? I think that the contrasting color of the two metals would have made this a more interesting shot. Good DOF', '2005-04-21 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311295, 168173, 10261, '<td valign="top"><br/>The scissors seem like an awkward addition to an otherwise good photograph.</td>', 'The scissors seem like an awkward addition to an otherwise good photograph.', '2005-04-21 16:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311300, 168659, 10261, '<td valign="top">Without the context of the challenge I would not have been able to tell that the center image was of papers. Creative take on the challenge topic.</td>', 'Without the context of the challenge I would not have been able to tell that the center image was of papers. Creative take on the challenge topic.', '2005-04-21 16:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311303, 168594, 10261, '<td valign="top">poorly lit, contrast too low, feet add nothing of value to the image</td>', 'poorly lit, contrast too low, feet add nothing of value to the image', '2005-04-21 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311345, 167246, 27845, '<td valign="top">I feel like you didn''t do much for this picture. The creativity comes solely from the statue, which is a work of art in itself. I don''t think that your approach to photograph the stonehead adds anything creative. Rotating it -90° doesn''t help either. 3.</td>', 'I feel like you didn''t do much for this picture. The creativity comes solely from the statue, which is a work of art in itself. I don''t think that your approach to photograph the stonehead adds anything creative. Rotating it -90° doesn''t help either. 3.', '2005-04-21 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311352, 168652, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your picture is out of focus and blown out on some parts of the rock. Switch your camera to ''macro'' mode for close-up photographs. Reduce the exposure time or decrease your aperture to make your picture darker, in order to avoid areas of pure white.<br/>I think a lower perspective would have improved this shot, as if a bug or an ant was seeing the stone. 3.</td>', 'Your picture is out of focus and blown out on some parts of the rock. Switch your camera to ''macro'' mode for close-up photographs. Reduce the exposure time or decrease your aperture to make your picture darker, in order to avoid areas of pure white.I think a lower perspective would have improved this shot, as if a bug or an ant was seeing the stone. 3.', '2005-04-21 17:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311359, 168673, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, nice textures. The composition of the big stone against the background is too stable for my taste. I would rotate the image 30° clockwise, if cropping allows that. You''d get much more dinamic lines and the stones would look even less stable, thus more difficult to balance. 5.</td>', 'Good DOF, nice textures. The composition of the big stone against the background is too stable for my taste. I would rotate the image 30° clockwise, if cropping allows that. You''d get much more dinamic lines and the stones would look even less stable, thus more difficult to balance. 5.', '2005-04-21 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311499, 168458, 36324, '<td valign="top">Scored higher if the clutter was out of the foreground.</td>', 'Scored higher if the clutter was out of the foreground.', '2005-04-21 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
