(1312864, 166682, 27482, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot of a tiger, I would have rated this high in "wildlife" or something similar but what has this shot got to do with the theme of rock paper scissors.  I know according to the challenge specifications you only need to have one of those items in the shot but here the rock is in such a minor role that IMHO this shot is totally off topic.  Please PM with me if you dissagree but I felt that you were entitled to an explanation as to why I am only giving this a 4.  I would probably have given this 7-8 if this had been on topic.</td>', 'A very nice shot of a tiger, I would have rated this high in "wildlife" or something similar but what has this shot got to do with the theme of rock paper scissors.  I know according to the challenge specifications you only need to have one of those items in the shot but here the rock is in such a minor role that IMHO this shot is totally off topic.  Please PM with me if you dissagree but I felt that you were entitled to an explanation as to why I am only giving this a 4.  I would probably have given this 7-8 if this had been on topic.', '2005-04-22 09:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
