(1314898, 168087, 34836, '<td valign="top">Great photo composition.  Glad to see all three elements.  The string shows on top and the paper is washed out.  I think B&amp;W hurt this a little because the scissors are lost in the black background.  I couldn''t give you a great score because of this, but I still think it''s a good photo.</td>', 'Great photo composition.  Glad to see all three elements.  The string shows on top and the paper is washed out.  I think B&W hurt this a little because the scissors are lost in the black background.  I couldn''t give you a great score because of this, but I still think it''s a good photo.', '2005-04-23 08:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314909, 168287, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice colourful photo but why no title.</td>', 'Nice colourful photo but why no title.', '2005-04-23 08:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314911, 167612, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great shot.Great lighting and motion blur. 9</td>', 'Great shot.Great lighting and motion blur. 9', '2005-04-23 08:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314951, 167378, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the detail in the edges of the paper.  I might have tried croping so that the edges and top of the stack are not visible so that the frame is filled with the "stripes".</td>', 'I like the colors and the detail in the edges of the paper.  I might have tried croping so that the edges and top of the stack are not visible so that the frame is filled with the "stripes".', '2005-04-23 09:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314962, 168483, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like the warm tones.  I think the next thing I might do is to try to get the lighting to be more even.  Paper is maybe just a bit over exposed and the others are edging into under exposure near the edges.  A second or third light source might help that.  The yellowish reflection just over the rock is distracting.  I gave it a 6.</td>', 'I really like the warm tones.  I think the next thing I might do is to try to get the lighting to be more even.  Paper is maybe just a bit over exposed and the others are edging into under exposure near the edges.  A second or third light source might help that.  The yellowish reflection just over the rock is distracting.  I gave it a 6.', '2005-04-23 09:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314970, 168405, 34059, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting, I love it!</td>', 'excellent lighting, I love it!', '2005-04-23 10:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315009, 168493, 7190, '<td valign="top">You could have presented this upside down and think it would have been a stronger presentation</td>', 'You could have presented this upside down and think it would have been a stronger presentation', '2005-04-23 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315010, 168297, 34059, '<td valign="top">creative and interesting picture! the fabric in the mirror is a bit distracting, anyway a 7 from me</td>', 'creative and interesting picture! the fabric in the mirror is a bit distracting, anyway a 7 from me', '2005-04-23 10:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315013, 168170, 34059, '<td valign="top">the paper is over-exposed, and the left side of the picture is too dark... anyway I like very much the soft tone of the background, nice job!</td>', 'the paper is over-exposed, and the left side of the picture is too dark... anyway I like very much the soft tone of the background, nice job!', '2005-04-23 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
