(1315662, 168271, 36634, '<td valign="top">crap</td>', 'crap', '2005-04-23 16:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315684, 168154, 33947, '<td valign="top">I really like the notion of a "Stone Poem," and I like the inteplay of shapes, light and shadows. I like that you''ve positioned yourself so that you have a group of them in one area, and one apart on the left. Intriguing shot.</td>', 'I really like the notion of a "Stone Poem," and I like the inteplay of shapes, light and shadows. I like that you''ve positioned yourself so that you have a group of them in one area, and one apart on the left. Intriguing shot.', '2005-04-23 17:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315702, 168414, 30896, '<td valign="top">the snake is beautiful and softness works imho very well here - i would give more than 8 if you got the challenge topic more into focus (or may be i would not because that would spoil the snake :-)</td>', 'the snake is beautiful and softness works imho very well here - i would give more than 8 if you got the challenge topic more into focus (or may be i would not because that would spoil the snake :-)', '2005-04-23 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315880, 167979, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the way the surfaces of the stones are lit as well as the landing on the other side. I also like that the biggest stone, or at least the one that looks biggest, is in the foreground,  and I like that there are an odd number of stones. Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the way the surfaces of the stones are lit as well as the landing on the other side. I also like that the biggest stone, or at least the one that looks biggest, is in the foreground,  and I like that there are an odd number of stones. Nice composition.', '2005-04-23 19:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315890, 167984, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great title! I wish I had a dollar for every sheet of paper I''ve wadded up. Very effective lighting and shot.</td>', 'Great idea and great title! I wish I had a dollar for every sheet of paper I''ve wadded up. Very effective lighting and shot.', '2005-04-23 19:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315895, 166699, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stone outcroppings. The curves are very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful stone outcroppings. The curves are very pleasing to the eye.', '2005-04-23 20:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315952, 167624, 24970, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice soft lighting. Not the most interesting of subjects, but a pleasing picture nonetheless.</td>', 'Good composition and nice soft lighting. Not the most interesting of subjects, but a pleasing picture nonetheless.', '2005-04-23 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315955, 168297, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love this! The focus and colors are great, and the humor is much appreciated.</td>', 'I love this! The focus and colors are great, and the humor is much appreciated.', '2005-04-23 21:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315957, 167813, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The texture is amazing and the contrast in light is well-done.</td>', 'I really like this. The texture is amazing and the contrast in light is well-done.', '2005-04-23 21:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315961, 166424, 24970, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is nice but I wish there was something a little more intersting to look at. It has good potential though, I like shots like this.</td>', 'The lighting in this is nice but I wish there was something a little more intersting to look at. It has good potential though, I like shots like this.', '2005-04-23 21:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315962, 166929, 24970, '<td valign="top">Somehow you took these subjects and made an elegant picture. The colors have a lot to do with it, I think. Nice job.</td>', 'Somehow you took these subjects and made an elegant picture. The colors have a lot to do with it, I think. Nice job.', '2005-04-23 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315966, 168258, 24970, '<td valign="top">A little cluttered, though the "defeated" scissors in the background add a nice touch to the story the picture tells.</td>', 'A little cluttered, though the "defeated" scissors in the background add a nice touch to the story the picture tells.', '2005-04-23 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315971, 168073, 24970, '<td valign="top">The water feels like it''s moving to me, it''s a very interesting effect. Would like to see the girl placed somewhere other than dead center, possibly farther right in the frame with more water on the left.</td>', 'The water feels like it''s moving to me, it''s a very interesting effect. Would like to see the girl placed somewhere other than dead center, possibly farther right in the frame with more water on the left.', '2005-04-23 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315974, 166897, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice tecture, color, and sharpness. Maybe a small black border would be good to give it a more finished feeling.</td>', 'Nice tecture, color, and sharpness. Maybe a small black border would be good to give it a more finished feeling.', '2005-04-23 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315978, 167545, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. It''s a little unsettling to me that the lines of the fan converge at a slightly different point than the scissors, but other than that it''s a very pleasing picture. Captures a feeling of serenity and simplicity.</td>', 'I like the lighting. It''s a little unsettling to me that the lines of the fan converge at a slightly different point than the scissors, but other than that it''s a very pleasing picture. Captures a feeling of serenity and simplicity.', '2005-04-23 21:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315980, 167274, 24970, '<td valign="top">A little less rock on the bottom would help this. I like the way you focused the light on Kermit.</td>', 'A little less rock on the bottom would help this. I like the way you focused the light on Kermit.', '2005-04-23 21:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315985, 168002, 24970, '<td valign="top">This gets a little Too out of focus in the bottom right. Apologies if the effect was intended, but it''s bothersome to me. Good idea and color though.</td>', 'This gets a little Too out of focus in the bottom right. Apologies if the effect was intended, but it''s bothersome to me. Good idea and color though.', '2005-04-23 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315988, 168683, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft picture. I''d prefer a little less space on the bottom, but other than that, the lighting you have makes this beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice soft picture. I''d prefer a little less space on the bottom, but other than that, the lighting you have makes this beautiful.', '2005-04-23 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315991, 166774, 24970, '<td valign="top">Would help to rotate this a bit counterclockwise, otherwise very pretty.</td>', 'Would help to rotate this a bit counterclockwise, otherwise very pretty.', '2005-04-23 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315994, 168416, 24970, '<td valign="top">Did you try cropping this just above the yellow part of the rock (keeping the top half of the picture)? I kinda like that, you have a pretty sky to work with. As it is, the flash that illuminates half the picture is a bit off-putting.</td>', 'Did you try cropping this just above the yellow part of the rock (keeping the top half of the picture)? I kinda like that, you have a pretty sky to work with. As it is, the flash that illuminates half the picture is a bit off-putting.', '2005-04-23 21:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316000, 168621, 24970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, color, and focus. I almost think the exposure was a bit too long, the lack of any detail in the pool is slightly disturbing. Pretty shot, in any case.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, color, and focus. I almost think the exposure was a bit too long, the lack of any detail in the pool is slightly disturbing. Pretty shot, in any case.', '2005-04-23 21:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316007, 168713, 24970, '<td valign="top">Well done. This is a setting I''ve always thought beautiful in person, but it''s really hard to capture on film (or digitally, as the case may be). You''ve done an admirable job, this is pretty.</td>', 'Well done. This is a setting I''ve always thought beautiful in person, but it''s really hard to capture on film (or digitally, as the case may be). You''ve done an admirable job, this is pretty.', '2005-04-23 21:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316014, 166682, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the lighting and focus are great. I really hope people don''t misinterpret the challenge and mark you down for "not" meeting it.</td>', 'Nice capture, the lighting and focus are great. I really hope people don''t misinterpret the challenge and mark you down for "not" meeting it.', '2005-04-23 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316017, 168490, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. This must have taken a long time to set up. Makes for a very interesting shot that keeps me looking at it as I try to figure out what parts go with what. Could maybe use a little more intense lighting, but....nicely done.</td>', 'Wow. This must have taken a long time to set up. Makes for a very interesting shot that keeps me looking at it as I try to figure out what parts go with what. Could maybe use a little more intense lighting, but....nicely done.', '2005-04-23 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316019, 168414, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great capture, this is really well done. Nothing said the r/p/s had to be the subject of the picture, I hope people don''t misinterpret that and downgrade you for it, because this is better than a lot of the pics in this challenge. Hm. As I look at it again, maybe you could take a little off the right side to improve the composition, though the clean diagonal through it is nice.</td>', 'Great capture, this is really well done. Nothing said the r/p/s had to be the subject of the picture, I hope people don''t misinterpret that and downgrade you for it, because this is better than a lot of the pics in this challenge. Hm. As I look at it again, maybe you could take a little off the right side to improve the composition, though the clean diagonal through it is nice.', '2005-04-23 21:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316021, 168299, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing. This is pretty.</td>', 'Nice use of framing. This is pretty.', '2005-04-23 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316023, 168146, 24970, '<td valign="top">The composition on this works, it''s an interesting picture.</td>', 'The composition on this works, it''s an interesting picture.', '2005-04-23 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
