(1316066, 168629, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s so random.......and such a great shot! One of my top three. I love all the variation in greys and the lighting.</td>', 'Wow. That''s so random.......and such a great shot! One of my top three. I love all the variation in greys and the lighting.', '2005-04-23 22:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
