(1316234, 166682, 33560, '<td valign="top">Two problems 1)  the rock is a background  or minor element.  It could be cloned out and the photo would be essentially the same.  2) the rock is not rock, it''s some wierd manmade thing that vaguely resembles rock. so this is a photo which contains as a minor element a material designed to fool us into thinking it is rock.  If you''ve read this you have suffered the full measure of my punishment for not meeting the challenge.  It''s a nice photo of a tiger.  That''s not a paper tiger, is it?</td>', 'Two problems 1)  the rock is a background  or minor element.  It could be cloned out and the photo would be essentially the same.  2) the rock is not rock, it''s some wierd manmade thing that vaguely resembles rock. so this is a photo which contains as a minor element a material designed to fool us into thinking it is rock.  If you''ve read this you have suffered the full measure of my punishment for not meeting the challenge.  It''s a nice photo of a tiger.  That''s not a paper tiger, is it?', '2005-04-24 00:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
