(1317952, 168456, 25378, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I would have liked it better if the blades were focused better.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I would have liked it better if the blades were focused better.', '2005-04-24 11:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317962, 168661, 25378, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, nice execution. Could have been a little sharper though.</td>', 'Creative idea, nice execution. Could have been a little sharper though.', '2005-04-24 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318035, 167246, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice, technically a very good composition.  The stone statue is very clear and detailed.  I find the building in the background a tad bit distracting, possiby a larger f/stop to decrease the dof would have blurred the backgroud enough to where it doesn''t appear as part of the subject.  Just my thoughts.  <br/></td>', 'Very nice, technically a very good composition.  The stone statue is very clear and detailed.  I find the building in the background a tad bit distracting, possiby a larger f/stop to decrease the dof would have blurred the backgroud enough to where it doesn''t appear as part of the subject.  Just my thoughts.  ', '2005-04-24 11:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318082, 167875, 21367, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat shot.  Carvings are clear and focused.  I might have adjusted the shadows level up a bit to bring out just a little more detail in the faces.  For myself I would have chosen a portrait crop for this situation.  Using the thirds rule, I would have the taller statue in the left third, smaller on in the center and negative space (water) in the right third.</td>', 'Pretty neat shot.  Carvings are clear and focused.  I might have adjusted the shadows level up a bit to bring out just a little more detail in the faces.  For myself I would have chosen a portrait crop for this situation.  Using the thirds rule, I would have the taller statue in the left third, smaller on in the center and negative space (water) in the right third.', '2005-04-24 11:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
