(1318551, 168297, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute idea. the scissors really look like the ballerinas in the strecthing positions. lighting is pretty harsh here with the strong wall shadows. also, the fabric in the background is distracting</td>', 'cute idea. the scissors really look like the ballerinas in the strecthing positions. lighting is pretty harsh here with the strong wall shadows. also, the fabric in the background is distracting', '2005-04-24 13:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
