(1318584, 168659, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever idea. the clothes line with images looks great and I like the basket in the foreground, but the trees behind are too cluttered.</td>', 'clever idea. the clothes line with images looks great and I like the basket in the foreground, but the trees behind are too cluttered.', '2005-04-24 13:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
