(1318752, 168435, 35357, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, shining a laser on the quartz?  I''m guessing you''re one of those darned ribbon-winners, well, here''s your [10] from me too.</td>', 'Cool effect, shining a laser on the quartz?  I''m guessing you''re one of those darned ribbon-winners, well, here''s your [10] from me too.', '2005-04-24 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318755, 168652, 23318, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit over processed. Just didn''t please the eyes. Because of this, the rock looks very odd. THe highlights off of the rock also make it tougher to look at.</td>', 'This looks a bit over processed. Just didn''t please the eyes. Because of this, the rock looks very odd. THe highlights off of the rock also make it tougher to look at.', '2005-04-24 14:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318772, 167246, 23318, '<td valign="top">The background made this hard to not feel uncomfortable viewing it. Rotating it back to parallel with the ground could have helped. <br/> <br/>Could also have worked by blurring out the background with a smaller depth of field. <br/> <br/>I don''t know what''s behind you but shooting from the other side could have been better as well.</td>', 'The background made this hard to not feel uncomfortable viewing it. Rotating it back to parallel with the ground could have helped.  Could also have worked by blurring out the background with a smaller depth of field.  I don''t know what''s behind you but shooting from the other side could have been better as well.', '2005-04-24 14:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318782, 168073, 23318, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and the rock, gave it a 5. Might have been a 7 or an 8 if the girl was sitting on the rock looking out, or at least looked like she was there for the picture. This looks like you wanted the picture of the rock, and she was just in the way.  It just takes that little bit away from the overall appeal.</td>', 'Love the subject and the rock, gave it a 5. Might have been a 7 or an 8 if the girl was sitting on the rock looking out, or at least looked like she was there for the picture. This looks like you wanted the picture of the rock, and she was just in the way.  It just takes that little bit away from the overall appeal.', '2005-04-24 14:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318806, 166358, 35357, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe that''s a rock silhouette, looks like trees to me. :-O  Nice sunset though.  Maybe if the challenge were "Sunset, Paper, Scissors" you get better than a 5 from me.<br/>:-(</td>', 'I don''t believe that''s a rock silhouette, looks like trees to me. :-O  Nice sunset though.  Maybe if the challenge were "Sunset, Paper, Scissors" you get better than a 5 from me.:-(', '2005-04-24 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
