(1318845, 168652, 35357, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a rock to me, I think you''re trying to pull the wool over my eyes with a chunk of plaster or something.<br/>:-)</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a rock to me, I think you''re trying to pull the wool over my eyes with a chunk of plaster or something.:-)', '2005-04-24 14:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
