(1319366, 166358, 31230, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2005-04-24 16:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319465, 168576, 23318, '<td valign="top">The problem with infrared photography, is that everything feels cold, or doesn''t settle right. I think that this image in standard color probably would have rated better with me.</td>', 'The problem with infrared photography, is that everything feels cold, or doesn''t settle right. I think that this image in standard color probably would have rated better with me.', '2005-04-24 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319477, 168125, 23318, '<td valign="top">II like the image itself, but I think by removing some of the foreground to make the image more of a landscape than square and minimizing the border, it would have scored quite a bit better with me.</td>', 'II like the image itself, but I think by removing some of the foreground to make the image more of a landscape than square and minimizing the border, it would have scored quite a bit better with me.', '2005-04-24 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319485, 168394, 23318, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but didn''t like that the images were so far on top of each other. I think that by spreading them out in the frame just a bit, to be able to tell where one ends, and the other begins would have allowed me to understand it a bit better, and bring up my score quite a bit.</td>', 'I like the idea, but didn''t like that the images were so far on top of each other. I think that by spreading them out in the frame just a bit, to be able to tell where one ends, and the other begins would have allowed me to understand it a bit better, and bring up my score quite a bit.', '2005-04-24 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319491, 168506, 23318, '<td valign="top">Your backgraound and such is very distracting in this image,. It just doesn''t seem to come together the way I think you intended it to. I think by cropping a bit lower on the bag, and maybe cropping out a bit more of the dirt in front of the ducks, you may have accomplished more of what you were looking for.</td>', 'Your backgraound and such is very distracting in this image,. It just doesn''t seem to come together the way I think you intended it to. I think by cropping a bit lower on the bag, and maybe cropping out a bit more of the dirt in front of the ducks, you may have accomplished more of what you were looking for.', '2005-04-24 16:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319516, 168154, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting subject... I''m not familiar with the site, but I find my eyes  pulling towards the building, which makes the subject dissappear. If you really like the subject, I''d look around for a place to shoot from that is unique. I might try to see if I can shoot from the window of the building, and possibly at different times of the day.</td>', 'This is a really interesting subject... I''m not familiar with the site, but I find my eyes  pulling towards the building, which makes the subject dissappear. If you really like the subject, I''d look around for a place to shoot from that is unique. I might try to see if I can shoot from the window of the building, and possibly at different times of the day.', '2005-04-24 16:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319532, 168125, 4090, '<td valign="top">wow.... 10</td>', 'wow.... 10', '2005-04-24 17:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319546, 168576, 4090, '<td valign="top">stunning - will be back after the challenge</td>', 'stunning - will be back after the challenge', '2005-04-24 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319550, 168438, 23318, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, I gave it a 6. I think the shadows on her lovely skin may make it blend into the rocks a bit more than I would have liked. Either a stronger bokeh on the rocks, or some additional light from behind the camera might have helped.</td>', 'Great portrait, I gave it a 6. I think the shadows on her lovely skin may make it blend into the rocks a bit more than I would have liked. Either a stronger bokeh on the rocks, or some additional light from behind the camera might have helped.', '2005-04-24 17:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319941, 166929, 25952, '<td valign="top">this paper''s shape is a bit interesting to look at, otherwise this is nothing more than a shot of objects, that doesn''t really do much. technically good, not that creative though. I''ll give a 6.</td>', 'this paper''s shape is a bit interesting to look at, otherwise this is nothing more than a shot of objects, that doesn''t really do much. technically good, not that creative though. I''ll give a 6.', '2005-04-24 19:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
