(1319966, 168416, 25952, '<td valign="top">well, the color in this shot is great. If this is not the on camera flash I suggest you take the flash off your camera and place it a few feet to your left to give a more even and natural look to the lighting of the foreground. Also I may like to see more sky and less grass here.</td>', 'well, the color in this shot is great. If this is not the on camera flash I suggest you take the flash off your camera and place it a few feet to your left to give a more even and natural look to the lighting of the foreground. Also I may like to see more sky and less grass here.', '2005-04-24 19:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319974, 168146, 25952, '<td valign="top">the subject of this shot is clearly the flowers, so in that respect I don''t feel like this fits the challenge very well, but that''s just my opinion. You still have scissors in the shot which technically makes it fit I guess. I think this would be a decent shot more closely cropped and without the scissors (which would make it unsuitable for the challenge...I''m just talking in general) as is though a 6</td>', 'the subject of this shot is clearly the flowers, so in that respect I don''t feel like this fits the challenge very well, but that''s just my opinion. You still have scissors in the shot which technically makes it fit I guess. I think this would be a decent shot more closely cropped and without the scissors (which would make it unsuitable for the challenge...I''m just talking in general) as is though a 6', '2005-04-24 19:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320144, 168435, 6678, '<td valign="top">Very clever lighting on the ''pet'' rock.</td>', 'Very clever lighting on the ''pet'' rock.', '2005-04-24 19:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320159, 167368, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this picture succeeds very well in meeting the challenge. From a technical standpoint, I wish there was a bit more room above the child''s head. Otherwise the focus and exposure is quite good and fine detail is preserved well.</td>', 'I think this picture succeeds very well in meeting the challenge. From a technical standpoint, I wish there was a bit more room above the child''s head. Otherwise the focus and exposure is quite good and fine detail is preserved well.', '2005-04-24 19:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320173, 166921, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the humor in this shot. I think this succeeds in where many failed in that while others have placed elements of all three (which I don''t feel was necessary) items, yours actually has a coherent and effective composition. Well done, this is my top pick for this challenge. 10</td>', 'Love the humor in this shot. I think this succeeds in where many failed in that while others have placed elements of all three (which I don''t feel was necessary) items, yours actually has a coherent and effective composition. Well done, this is my top pick for this challenge. 10', '2005-04-24 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320202, 167010, 22479, '<td valign="top">I love the rich saturated colors, and the building structure with its unique geometric design makes for a fantastic challenge subject. Oh, and there''s the rocks at the base. Great entry.</td>', 'I love the rich saturated colors, and the building structure with its unique geometric design makes for a fantastic challenge subject. Oh, and there''s the rocks at the base. Great entry.', '2005-04-24 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320209, 168447, 35513, '<td valign="top">This picture really speaks to me.  I love the simplicity of it, coupled with the difference in texture between the rock and the leaves.  The color of the leaves really makes the surface of the rock pop out.  Well done!</td>', 'This picture really speaks to me.  I love the simplicity of it, coupled with the difference in texture between the rock and the leaves.  The color of the leaves really makes the surface of the rock pop out.  Well done!', '2005-04-24 20:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320211, 167612, 35513, '<td valign="top">The mist rolling over the water, the way the rock line juts into the sky, the difference in light from back to front....I love it all!  A truly wonderful photo.  Makes me miss the ocean :-)</td>', 'The mist rolling over the water, the way the rock line juts into the sky, the difference in light from back to front....I love it all!  A truly wonderful photo.  Makes me miss the ocean :-)', '2005-04-24 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320213, 167545, 35513, '<td valign="top">Excellent capturing of the "zen" mood.  Wonderful job on the lighting!  You''ll have to tell me how you work that someday ;-)</td>', 'Excellent capturing of the "zen" mood.  Wonderful job on the lighting!  You''ll have to tell me how you work that someday ;-)', '2005-04-24 20:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320217, 167423, 35513, '<td valign="top">The mood of this photo really speaks to me.  I love the darkness, the damp, the mist.  In my opinion, a well composed shot.</td>', 'The mood of this photo really speaks to me.  I love the darkness, the damp, the mist.  In my opinion, a well composed shot.', '2005-04-24 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
