(1320856, 168518, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love the colorful composition here. The figures dancing around the crystal is a fun visual. While the addition of the scissors seems like an afterthought to me, this is still one of my 3 favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I love the colorful composition here. The figures dancing around the crystal is a fun visual. While the addition of the scissors seems like an afterthought to me, this is still one of my 3 favorites in this challenge.', '2005-04-24 23:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320858, 168697, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love seeing the mundane elevated into something interesting and you have certainly accomplished that here. The concentric curls combined with the strong diagonal lines of the paper pads is very visually pleasing. I liked the choice of mixed colors as well. One of my 3 favs in this challenge.</td>', 'I love seeing the mundane elevated into something interesting and you have certainly accomplished that here. The concentric curls combined with the strong diagonal lines of the paper pads is very visually pleasing. I liked the choice of mixed colors as well. One of my 3 favs in this challenge.', '2005-04-24 23:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
