(1321174, 167368, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a very good idea; it combines the rock with both paper and scissors in a meaningful scene. But the image itself is not as strong as it could be. I''d like to see more of the kid''s face and more of what he is doing. I also think the wave is distracting.  Maybe a vertical shot from a lower viewpoint to the left would be better.<br/></td>', 'This is a very good idea; it combines the rock with both paper and scissors in a meaningful scene. But the image itself is not as strong as it could be. I''d like to see more of the kid''s face and more of what he is doing. I also think the wave is distracting.  Maybe a vertical shot from a lower viewpoint to the left would be better.', '2005-04-24 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321181, 167155, 34838, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright great lighting. I also like your idea.</td>', 'Nice and bright great lighting. I also like your idea.', '2005-04-24 23:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321186, 167880, 35334, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. When I first rated it, I did not appreciate that he tracks were scissors. Now I''m going back through and I''ve increased my vote on this one.<br/></td>', 'I really like this shot. When I first rated it, I did not appreciate that he tracks were scissors. Now I''m going back through and I''ve increased my vote on this one.', '2005-04-24 23:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321199, 167423, 34838, '<td valign="top">This is a really great pic. I like the way the rocks look really smooth and soft. Also they look cold burrrrrr lol</td>', 'This is a really great pic. I like the way the rocks look really smooth and soft. Also they look cold burrrrrr lol', '2005-04-24 23:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
