(1327041, 168287, 35169, '<td valign="top">I always have a hard time with images that (I feel) are unnecessarily overly sharp, so I won''t hold that against you.  This is a good composition idea. If you were to reshoot it: for an ad shot, one less pair of scizzors (the red ones on their side partically hidden) would have made the shot cleaner.</td>', 'I always have a hard time with images that (I feel) are unnecessarily overly sharp, so I won''t hold that against you.  This is a good composition idea. If you were to reshoot it: for an ad shot, one less pair of scizzors (the red ones on their side partically hidden) would have made the shot cleaner.', '2005-04-26 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
