(1327061, 166781, 35169, '<td valign="top">How cute.... nice even lighting. The scizzors look awkward to me, maybe just laid down woulda filled the area and given more emphasis (sp sorry) on the hero.  Just my opinion...</td>', 'How cute.... nice even lighting. The scizzors look awkward to me, maybe just laid down woulda filled the area and given more emphasis (sp sorry) on the hero.  Just my opinion...', '2005-04-26 02:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
