(1329130, 168628, 4517, '<td valign="top">Now this is a serious rock without which we wouldn`t be here. This is pretty sharp for such a high magnification but i expect you`ve been told it`s not by people who have never tried this. Very good effort. 9</td>', 'Now this is a serious rock without which we wouldn`t be here. This is pretty sharp for such a high magnification but i expect you`ve been told it`s not by people who have never tried this. Very good effort. 9', '2005-04-26 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
