(1329228, 166929, 29148, '<td valign="top">The light in the roll is attractive. A prettier rock would have helped, or one with a contrasting color.</td>', 'The light in the roll is attractive. A prettier rock would have helped, or one with a contrasting color.', '2005-04-26 18:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
