(1329482, 168377, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like thisd interpretation of the challenge, and I love the framing of the image. The built-in "almost symmetry" of the slope of the pavement is quite compelling. The color is wonderful. Very strong entry.</td>', 'I like thisd interpretation of the challenge, and I love the framing of the image. The built-in "almost symmetry" of the slope of the pavement is quite compelling. The color is wonderful. Very strong entry.', '2005-04-26 19:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1329486, 168447, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice rock picture, indeed. The rock itself feels less sharp than the leaves surrounding, but I suspect that''s just the nature of the surface. Nevertheless, it''s odd that the leaves are "harder" than the rock, isn''t it? Stron entry.</td>', 'Very nice rock picture, indeed. The rock itself feels less sharp than the leaves surrounding, but I suspect that''s just the nature of the surface. Nevertheless, it''s odd that the leaves are "harder" than the rock, isn''t it? Stron entry.', '2005-04-26 19:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
