(1329923, 168055, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very clever way to incorporate all three into your image.  I like the way you arranged the three objects (composition) and the lighting is very good considering having to work with the bright scissors.  Very good black/white points.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very clever way to incorporate all three into your image.  I like the way you arranged the three objects (composition) and the lighting is very good considering having to work with the bright scissors.  Very good black/white points.  Good luck.', '2005-04-26 22:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
