(1330632, 168058, 34390, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sabphoto:</b></div><hr/><i> I think your DOF is pretty good here but I wonder if a lower angle would give a better view of the wall...of course then you have that shadow to tend with so maybe I''m way off.  Good luck </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments. I always appreciate it when people write something so that I can pick up pointers for next time. This wall was almost impossible to get a good angle on because there were so many trees in the way.</td>', 'Originally posted by sabphoto: I think your DOF is pretty good here but I wonder if a lower angle would give a better view of the wall...of course then you have that shadow to tend with so maybe I''m way off.  Good luck   Thanks for your comments. I always appreciate it when people write something so that I can pick up pointers for next time. This wall was almost impossible to get a good angle on because there were so many trees in the way.', '2005-04-27 02:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
