(1331622, 167956, 25095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bhound:</b></div><hr/><i> Missing an element here. Adding the rock would have scored this higher from me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just wondering what you meant by missing an element?  The challenge was to include at least one of the elements...it didn''t have to include all of them.  I think a lot of people didn''t read the description for the challenge and just shot off the cuff, this hurt some good photographers.  A rock in this image would have thrown off the entire image and ruined it.  It''s sad that you voted lower becuase you may not have understood the challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by bhound: Missing an element here. Adding the rock would have scored this higher from me.   Just wondering what you meant by missing an element?  The challenge was to include at least one of the elements...it didn''t have to include all of them.  I think a lot of people didn''t read the description for the challenge and just shot off the cuff, this hurt some good photographers.  A rock in this image would have thrown off the entire image and ruined it.  It''s sad that you voted lower becuase you may not have understood the challenge.', '2005-04-27 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
