(1331976, 166811, 36102, '<td valign="top">****Thank you for all your comments******<br/> <br/>One person commented that this didn''t look very planned.  Well they were right, I had the scissors set proped up on their edge but Diego had other ideas.  I tried to get the shot for about 30 min''s then just gave up and took the one of him trashing my idea, I was using natural sun light so I had precious little time to work with. <br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', '****Thank you for all your comments****** One person commented that this didn''t look very planned.  Well they were right, I had the scissors set proped up on their edge but Diego had other ideas.  I tried to get the shot for about 30 min''s then just gave up and took the one of him trashing my idea, I was using natural sun light so I had precious little time to work with.  Thanks again!', '2005-04-27 10:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
