(1332278, 167128, 24890, '<td valign="top">Well, my score was reflective to what that I thought I would get. The comments are definitely what I was out for. I knew this challenge would be swamped with beautiful landscape shots with rocks and I wanted to add a bit of humor.<br/> <br/>My 8 yr old made my "paper Mr. Bill", and had a lot of fun helping me out  with this challenge. Thanks for all the comments. I am glad that you enjoyed it.</td>', 'Well, my score was reflective to what that I thought I would get. The comments are definitely what I was out for. I knew this challenge would be swamped with beautiful landscape shots with rocks and I wanted to add a bit of humor. My 8 yr old made my "paper Mr. Bill", and had a lot of fun helping me out  with this challenge. Thanks for all the comments. I am glad that you enjoyed it.', '2005-04-27 11:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
