(1332724, 167423, 20204, '<td valign="top">Thank you all so much for the comments, and of course the votes!  I almost didn''t enter this as I was most excited about my Open Challenge entry which was shot the same evening.  Glad I didn''t let it pass!  I really feel that this image preserved what I experienced that night, and it''s very rewarding to see that others could enjoy it with me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-27 11:36:48.</i></td>', 'Thank you all so much for the comments, and of course the votes!  I almost didn''t enter this as I was most excited about my Open Challenge entry which was shot the same evening.  Glad I didn''t let it pass!  I really feel that this image preserved what I experienced that night, and it''s very rewarding to see that others could enjoy it with me.', '2005-04-27 12:36:28.000000', '2005-04-27 12:36:48.000000', 0),
