(1334201, 168002, 25095, '<td valign="top">I loved your image though did give it a 9 for the comments I mentioned.  I have to comment to tell you don''t get discouraged, if you''ll look at the images in the profile for the one that said "poor quality image..." you will notice that they have a TOTALLY different expectation on what quality is.  You will find here that you can''t please most everyone as it is usually the person interrpertation of what the challenge is about.<br/> <br/>Still love your image.</td>', 'I loved your image though did give it a 9 for the comments I mentioned.  I have to comment to tell you don''t get discouraged, if you''ll look at the images in the profile for the one that said "poor quality image..." you will notice that they have a TOTALLY different expectation on what quality is.  You will find here that you can''t please most everyone as it is usually the person interrpertation of what the challenge is about. Still love your image.', '2005-04-27 17:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
