(1337660, 166921, 19672, '<td valign="top">gattamarta...<br/> <br/>The meaning of the note is an extremely cute word play on geological (rock) terminology.  They''re all descriptors for various type of rock formations.<br/> <br/>Who the heck gave this a "1"...who ever you are...you''re a !@#$%tard.<br/> <br/>There is absolutely no reason to give this a "1". The fact that it had ALL three potential criteria (rock, paper, scissors) is justification for at least a 2.  It''s a reasonably clear photo. Slightly dark (but that''s more dependent on monitor).<br/> <br/></td>', 'gattamarta... The meaning of the note is an extremely cute word play on geological (rock) terminology.  They''re all descriptors for various type of rock formations. Who the heck gave this a "1"...who ever you are...you''re a !@#$%tard. There is absolutely no reason to give this a "1". The fact that it had ALL three potential criteria (rock, paper, scissors) is justification for at least a 2.  It''s a reasonably clear photo. Slightly dark (but that''s more dependent on monitor). ', '2005-04-28 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
